cff-version: 1.2.0
title: From Python to Rust and Back Again
message: >-
  Please cite this lesson when referring to it in publications or reusing,
  adapting, or expanding its training material.
type: dataset
authors:
  - given-names: Jason
    family-names: Wohlgemuth
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2057-9115
abstract: >-
  A workshop for Python developers learning how to introduce Rust into an
  existing project incrementally. The lesson maps familiar Python concepts to
  Rust, introduces ownership and compile-time guarantees, and builds a native
  Python extension with PyO3 and Maturin.
license: CC-BY-4.0
